<title>THAILAND: Thai Nov C/A deficit narrows 21.7 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai Nov C/A deficit narrows 21.7 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's November current account deficit narrowed to a preliminary 21.7 billion baht from an unchanged 30.2 billion baht deficit in October, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	   Nov 96	 Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p>				 21.7	   30.2	 33.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
